  "description": "A 2D label placement library for engineering drawings that automatically arranges labels to prevent overlaps with each other and blocked regions. Features 5 layout algorithms: Greedy, Bounded Backtracking, Simulated Annealing, Force-Directed, and Constraint Satisfaction. The geometry it works in comes from the GeometryHelper.PlaneGeometry package, which arrives as a dependency.",
